         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5f3a7056-f3ea-5964-e063-6394a90a65a0">
               <id root="5f3a7056-f3e9-5964-e063-6394a90a65a0"/>
               <code code="34071-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="WARNINGS SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>**Warnings**
  <br/>
For external use only.
  <br/>
Do not use:
 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>- on deep or puncture wounds, animal bites, serious burns, broken, infected, or irritated skin
  <br/>
- if you are allergic to diclofenac sodium or any ingredient in this product
 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Ask a doctor before use if you:</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>- have a history of stomach bleeding
  <br/>
- have heart disease or high blood pressure
  <br/>
- have kidney problems
  <br/>
- are taking aspirin, other nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs (NSAIDs), blood thinners, or other medications
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261101"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5f3a7056-f3ec-5964-e063-6394a90a65a0">
               <id root="5f3a7056-f3eb-5964-e063-6394a90a65a0"/>
               <code code="34067-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>When using this product:</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>- avoid contact with eyes and mucous membranes
  <br/>
- do not apply to wounds, broken skin, or irritated skin
  <br/>
- do not bandage or tightly wrap the treated area
  <br/>
- do not apply heat or cold packs before or after application
  <br/>
- wash hands after use
 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Stop use and ask a doctor if:</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>- symptoms worsen
  <br/>
- symptoms last more than 7 days
  <br/>
- symptoms clear up and occur again within a few days
  <br/>
- skin irritation, redness, swelling, or an allergic reaction occurs
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261101"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5f3a75d0-c076-5acf-e063-6294a90a65af">
               <id root="5f3a75d0-c075-5acf-e063-6294a90a65af"/>
               <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>- Adults and children 12 years of age and older:
  <br/>
Clean and dry the affected area. Apply a thin layer of cream to the affected area and gently rub in until absorbed. Use as directed. Wash hands after use unless the hands are being treated.
  <br/>
- Children under 12 years of age: Ask a doctor before use.
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261101"/>
            </section>
         </component>
